    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29008" root="عزم" body-key="E">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَزُومٌ</span></b>  [<i>Determined,</i> or <i>resolute;</i>] one <i>who perseveres in his determination until he attains that
which he seeks,</i> or <i>desires.</i> (Ham p. 532.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See
also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَوْزَمٌ</span>, in two places. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أُمُّ العِزْمِ</span>.

